Cell["\<\
Population passes through |2\:27e9 on its way to |1\:27e9, and part of it \
stays there. At the end of the pulse 9.6% of the population is in |2\:27e9:\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1606118752,ExpressionUUID->"6e1c99a5-dcef-9c28-1623-100ed49be772"],

